<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108016" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεύδιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>under the calm sky,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γέρανοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arat.
					1012
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὑπεύδια καὶ κατασκιαζόμενα
				τῶν δένδρων</span>
			<i>sheltered</i> . . trees, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				103.53
			</span></i>
			= Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				15.625
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>somewhat calm,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκτή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					1.584
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				3.1202
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. καὶ λεία θάλαττα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					1.41
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ὑ. τῆς θαλάσσης</span>”
				<i>a tolerable calm,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Them.</u>
					32
				</span></i>
			. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Arat.
			</span></i> l.c. metrigr., cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔδιος.</span>]</div>
